{title: I love the Lord and I won’t take it back}

{comment: Chorus}
I love the Lord and I won’t take it back
I love the Lord and I won’t take it back
I love the Lord and I won’t take it back
He has been so good to me

{comment: Bridge}
He’s been so good, so good, so good, so good, so very good
He’s been so good, so good, so good
He has been so good to me

{comment: Chorus 2}
I love Jesus, He’s my Savior
When storms are raging, He’s my shelter
Where He leads me, I will follow
I love Jesus and He loves me.
